# System Options themes wallpaper assignments.
# Format: <theme-slug>:<file in pictures/wallpapers/> (exactly one per theme,
# so `omarchy theme set` is deterministic).
# Custom themes (dirs under omarchy/themes/) land in
# ~/.config/omarchy/themes/<slug>/backgrounds/; stock themes (nord,
# everforest) land in ~/.config/omarchy/backgrounds/<slug>/.
